      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "(a) You can see why the first aorist is also known as the ‘sigmatic’ or ‘alpha’\naorist. Originally there was no α; ἔπαυσεν avoided confusion with ἔπαυσαν.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
