        796,
        914
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "(b) Revisit 102 and observe that we have here the -μην -σο -το middle endings.\nWith the loss of intervocalic sigma keenly in mind, you will understand how\nthe original 2s. ἐπαύσα-σο became ἐπαύσα-o and so ἐπαύσ-ω.",
