      "margin_number": 131,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "As you have seen above, the first aorist stem is typically formed by adding\nsa to the present stem: παύ-ω ‘I stop’ > παυ-σα. On to this is added the aug-\nment (ἔ + παυ-σα). The aorist stem is παυσα-.",
